That doesn't change. And plus,

258
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:34,217
it has to be at a distance where you
can swim back to shore without drowning.

259
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:36,160
I won't ever let you get away.

260
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,960
This tiresome feud between us ends now.

261
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:42,736
I can't have any trace of
your existence in my future.

262
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:44,817
Chulene, climb the rope.

263
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:46,841
Hurry up and come to the dolphin!

264
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:53,214
Emporio, because of Anastasia's
sacrificing himself to protect my father,

265
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:56,060
I'm still alive, but
that's the only reason.

266
00:16:57,340 --> 00:17:00,457
And thanks to Ermes buying
time attacking the priest,

267
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:03,540
I was able to extend my
rope to catch this dolphin.

268
00:17:03,800 --> 00:17:06,117
When dolphins let people
ride on their back,

269
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:09,457
I heard that they swim in a way
that their rider won't ever drown.

270
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:10,780
Hurry! Hurry!

271
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:12,885
Get over here already, Jolene!

272
00:17:12,980 --> 00:17:14,980
Your rope is unraveling even more!

273
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:18,437
I know without a doubt
that Dolphin is going

274
00:17:18,520 --> 00:17:21,226
to carry you somewhere
safe and out of danger.

275
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,560
What are you saying? Hurry!

276
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,821
You can still make it over to me!

277
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:28,080
Emporium, I can't go with you.

278
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:32,537
Wherever I go, the Priest will sense the
presence of the Joestar blood within me.

279
00:17:32,620 --> 00:17:35,417
And no matter how far I
run, I'll sense him too.

280
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:37,382
He'll keep following me forever.

281
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:42,266
If I stay here, you won't
be able to get away.

282
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:46,740
Everything will be okay, Emporio.

283
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:49,717
You'll be going the rest
of the way yourself.

284
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:50,960
You can do this.

285
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:53,813
I have total faith in your capabilities.

286
00:17:54,020 --> 00:17:58,314
The ones who died so that you could
live are Anastasia, our friend Ermes,

287
00:17:58,660 --> 00:17:59,840
and my father,

288
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,420
Jotaro Kucho.

289
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:04,880
Keep on living.

290
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,400
Your only hope!

291
00:18:06,820 --> 00:18:09,877
I don't know what the heck
you're even talking about!

292
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:11,540
No! Please don't go!

293
00:18:12,340 --> 00:18:17,380
Just wait! Hold on! Jolyne!
Stop! Don't leave me!

294
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:20,487
Hurry and pull yourself
off the rope already!

295
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:24,520
He's getting worn out.

296
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:27,314
I'll hold him off for as long as I can!

297
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:34,440
Bring it, Father Poochie!

298
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:38,820
Stone Ocean!

299
00:18:46,860 --> 00:18:47,690
No!

300
00:18:48,220 --> 00:18:49,050
Joliii!

301
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,800
Whoa, hey! What's that?

302
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:56,260
Is that the sun rising? No way!

303
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:58,437
The sun's coming up again already?

304
00:18:58,520 --> 00:19:00,837
It doesn't even look
like a sphere anymore!

305
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:03,038
It's more like a long belt of light!

306
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:06,240
The hands on my watch disappeared! No!

307
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:09,897
They're just going way too fast
for me to see with the naked eye!

308
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:11,260
The day's over!

309
00:19:11,820 --> 00:19:14,080
Now it's morning, and night again!

310
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:16,040
This is crazy!

311
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:18,680
Time is accelerating even more!

312
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,430
Shit!

313
00:19:21,513 --> 00:19:22,498
This is really bad!

314
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:24,137
Forget the canned food!

315
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:26,857
All the raw meat's gonna rot
and we can't eat it anymore!

316
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:27,770
Buy it out!

317
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,567
Buy out all the canned food!

318
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:31,407
We're gonna run out of food!

319
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:34,157
Look at all this window dust collecting!

320
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:35,475
The frame is rotting!

321
00:19:52,100 --> 00:19:53,160
Whoa! My teeth!

322
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:56,305
The implants I just got
put in are falling out!

323
00:19:58,700 --> 00:19:59,900
What the hell, man?

324
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:01,336
What's with the sky?

325
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:03,177
Where the fuck did the sun go?

326
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:05,917
Is that strip of light in the
sky supposed to be the sun?

327
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,920
Is the time noon or is it night?

328
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,357
What day of the week is it?

329
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,697
And for that matter, what's even the air?

330
00:20:11,780 --> 00:20:13,820
It's starting to get really cold.

331
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,706
The climate is changing, too.

332
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:20,860
What's going on?

333
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:24,037
Give her the rocks are changing
shape because of the waves.

334
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,414
Is time ever going to stop speeding up?

335
00:20:27,340 --> 00:20:28,380
How much more?

336
00:20:28,660 --> 00:20:31,484
How much longer is this
nightmare going to last?

337
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:48,000
Now even the terrain is changing, too!

338
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:58,640
What in the world is this? How bizarre.

339
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,412
It's only living things.

340
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,480
I can't breathe!

341
00:21:35,640 --> 00:21:42,500
What are you doing in here without
any clothes on? Huh? What the …?

342
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,609
Shut up and stop stalling!

343
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:47,117
You and the prisoners need to get dressed!

344
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,024
But why am I naked too, though?

345
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:50,760
I mean, what happened?

346
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,237
Time was going all fast, and then …

347
00:21:53,320 --> 00:21:54,261
This ain't good!

348
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:55,397
I'm naked on camera!

349
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,774
They'll misunderstand!

350
00:21:59,080 --> 00:22:00,020
Is this …?

351
00:22:01,220 --> 00:22:02,480
this place is

352
00:22:04,020 --> 00:22:06,540
I've been here I know it

353
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:11,237
this place is Green
Dolphin Street State Prison

354
00:22:11,320 --> 00:22:14,800
and I'm in the hallway in
front of the visiting room

355
00:22:27,020 --> 00:22:29,740
Although you think I cope

356
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:35,200
My head is filled with hope

357
00:22:36,620 --> 00:22:40,137
Of some place

358
00:22:40,220 --> 00:22:43,780
Other than here

359
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:49,980
Although you think I smile

360
00:22:51,860 --> 00:22:55,220
Inside and all the while

361
00:22:57,100 --> 00:23:03,480
I'm wondering about my destiny

362
00:23:06,020 --> 00:23:07,917
I'm thinking

363
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:13,197
about all

364
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:19,460
the things I'd like to do

365
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:29,217
I'm a dreamer,

366
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:34,357
a distant dreamer,

367
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:38,177
dreaming far

368
00:23:38,260 --> 00:23:44,560
away from today.

369
00:23:51,780 --> 00:23:52,610
Thank you.

370
00:24:20,080 --> 00:24:21,440
Thank you.
